    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Preference Learning from Physics-Based Feedback: Tuning <span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span> to Design BCC/B2 Superalloys
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Ghosh%2C+S">Satanu Ghosh</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Holgate%2C+C">Collin Holgate</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Brodnik%2C+N+R">Neal R. Brodnik</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Downey%2C+D">Doug Downey</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Daly%2C+S">Samantha Daly</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Pollock%2C+T+M">Tresa M. Pollock</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Carton%2C+S">Samuel Carton</a>
      
